**REGISTRO**
A participação nessa competição requer do competidor o conhecimento dos seguintes requisitos:

1. Tomar todos os cuidados referente ao COVID-19 e seguir o que será indicado pelo delegado e organizador da competição;
2. Conhecer as regras da WCA, pois é uma competição oficial;
3. Escolher os eventos a serem registrados com cuidado após revisar as guias Eventos e Cronograma. Preste atenção aos formatos das rodadas e seus cortes/limites;
4. Se inscrever através do site da WCA. A inscrição terá custo de R$ 30,00 (inscrição+camiseta) para os competidores pagos nos dias da competição durante o credenciamento.
5. Outras informações adicionais verifique no site da WCA ou entre em contato com o organizador através do e-mail (welbertmoutta@hotmail.com), bem como o delegado por meio do e-mail (gsantos@worldcubeassociation.org).

O acesso ao local será permitido mediante comprovação de esquema vacinal completo, ou, uma dose de vacina e teste negativo para Covid-19 do tipo PCR, realizado até 48 horas antes do ingresso no local, ou do tipo antígeno, realizado até 24 horas antes do ingresso no estabelecimento (para o competidor e o acompanhante). Para as crianças menores de 12 anos, será solicitado o teste negativo de Covid-19 do tipo PCR, realizado até 48 horas antes do ingresso no estabelecimento, ou do tipo antígeno, realizado até 24 horas antes do acesso ao local.

**REGISTRATION**
The participation in this competition requires the comprehension and acceptance of the following requirements:

1. Take all precautions regarding COVID-19 and follow what will be indicated by the delegate and the organizer;
2. Being familiar with the WCA rules, since this is an official competition;
3. Carefully choosing the events. Keep the rounds format, cutoffs and limits in mind.
1. Register through the WCA website.The registration fee is R$30,00 (registration+shirt) and must be paid on the days of competition during the registration. 
5. For additional information, check the WCA website or contact the organizer via email, (welbertmoutta@hotmail.com), or the delegate via email (gsantos@worldcubeassociation.org).

Access to the venue will be allowed upon proof of the complete vaccination schedule, or a dose of vaccine and negative test for Covid-19 of the PCR type, took up to 48 hours before entering the venue, or of the antigen type, took up to 24 hours before entry into the establishment (for both competitor and companion). For children under 12 years of age, a negative Covid-19 PCR test will be required, took within 48 hours before entering the establishment, or an antigen test took within 24 hours before entering the venue.

#The competition has been cancelled due to the ongoing Russo-Ukrainian War.#

![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBbFlUIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--8c1308d4d128f8bd97e1f01af0a568aca1847fb6/undefined%20-%20Imgur.png)

* Один участник может взять с собой **максимум 1 гостя**. Необходимо внести имя и фамилию гостя в комментарии при регистрации на соревнования на сайте WCA;
* Допуск на место проведения соревнований для участников и гостей будет происходить по документам:
  * Для участников и гостей младше 18 лет: **документ**, удостоверяющий личность (паспорт или свидетельство о рождении);
  * Для участников и гостей от 18 лет: **QR-код** сертификата вакцинированного против новой коронавирусной инфекции COVID-19 либо перенесшего новую коронавирусную инфекцию COVID-19 (с даты выздоровления прошло не более 6 календарных месяцев) либо **отрицательный результат ПЦР-тестирования** на выявление возбудителя новой коронавирусной инфекции COVID-19, проведенный не более чем за 72 часа до начала мероприятия или не более чем за 48 часов до въезда на территорию Республики Коми.

Больше информации в [группе ВКонтакте](https://vk.com/syktyvkaropen2022) и [вкладке "Особенности, связанные с COVID-19"](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/SyktyvkarOpen2022#17090-covid-19-covid-19-measures).
 
 ________________________________________
 
* One competitor can bring **only 1 guest** with them. You should add your guest’s full name to your registration comments;
* Competitors and guests must present the following documents to enter the venue:
 * For competitors and guests under the age of 18: valid national **ID document**;
 * For competitors and guests over 18 years old: **QR-code** of full COVID-19 vaccination or recent recovery (at most 6 month) or **negative for COVID-19** within 72 hours of the competition or within 48 hours before entry in Komi Republic.

More information on the [competition website](https://vk.com/syktyvkaropen2022) and in [COVID-19 Measures tab](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/competitions/SyktyvkarOpen2022#17090-covid-19-covid-19-measures).
